      "variant_id": "idp_transcription_linear",
      "segment_id": "p-0057",
      "sentence_id": "p-0057.s001",
      "source_text": "But here again I don't mean to say that I recognize this atmosphere rather I notice it when in philosophizing I read a line.",
      "source_text_sha256": "f7403a6baf8acc913a85f2ef7e843859bf50a7e033dfd73114a2e5ef8d42c392",
